repository-code: "https://github.com/emlavankhoahienma-hue/ai-smart-framing-camera"
abstract: >-
  Align Studio (created by Ace4youblade / Tran Van Khoa) is an open-source iOS 17+ camera application written in Swift, SwiftUI, Metal, Apple Vision, and CoreML (ANE). It specializes in real-time AI Compose, AI Photo Composition, and AI Smart Framing (AI Framing Camera)—providing universal subject detection, automated photography composition guidance (Rule of Thirds, Golden Ratio, Symmetry, Horizon, Leading Lines), 6-DoF Gyroscope EKF target tracking, ambient exposure control, and context-aware smart optical zoom.
